2", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569428_221985160670725_1956832022154885653_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g7pVANhOiiUQ7kNvwFSm1Lr&_nc_oc=AdqcGPpTtNsTylFulwR8SyCpZ36z_lGZoMEIDMIsLTPul6oDYxQgMiziPwLb8OI-L0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJxuVz9nejpsIIfHr2A_NZZdPgAGCV-QVwBmV6DrhukXg&oe=6AA40178"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "794121865642317", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035334_794121868975650_8463868109182604137_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i2Mk_TThTpwQ7kNvwFfZuk5&_nc_oc=AdrSzd0w8f4sG9dGcTVjcoXOQCQ9i9Cl-CBRJCXPtj2-ObN1dRmuAOihpnVZ7iTvxg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJi1QThH-m-FTyw__4IBuHG6K9IlHt1d2-Qxkn1YrtJkQ&oe=6AA41483"}, "display_name": "BattleGlide", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, jumping, and climbing walls. Choose the time of day you want to fight crime: day, night, and evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Handle weapons realistically. Disarm your enemies or give them a taste of their own medicine!\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans.", "short_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, and climbing walls, during the night, day and also evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to 